{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>ויחי</b> וירבו מאד ויחי יעקב. In gematria: ראה ס' רבוא (saw sixty myriads). And this is what is said: בראותו ילדיו — בראותו אותיות רבואות, ילדיו — עולה ס' (sixty), to say that he saw sixty myriads of his children. Another interpretation: וירבו מאד ויחי יעקב — teaches that he saw thirty myriads, for below it says מאד מאד and that is sixty myriads, and here only one מאד is written, which is the half. And so below six expressions are written: פרו וישרצו וירבו ויעצמו במאד מאד, and here only three are written: ויפרו וירבו מאד. And according to this interpretation expound thus: כי בראותו ילדיו — כ\"י עולה ל' (thirty), that he saw thirty myriads of his children. Another interpretation: ויחי יעקב בארץ — he did not live good days without suffering except as the count of ויחי — seventeen years from Joseph's birth until he was sold, and seventeen years in Egypt. Another interpretation: ויחי יעקב בארץ מצרים י\"ז שנה — the earlier ones were not life, for he said כי ארד אל בני אבל שאולה." "<b>שבע עשרה שנה</b> — corresponding to the seventeen years that he, Joseph, sustained him, seventeen years." "<b>ויהי ימי יעקב</b> — everywhere ויהי ימי is said, he did not reach the days of his fathers: ויהי ימי חנוך, ויהי ימי למך. And so everywhere where קריבה is said." "<b>שבע שנים וארבעים ומאת שנה</b> — counted the lesser first, which was not done for Abraham and Isaac. Because his days were few and evil, the lesser was mentioned first. And he lived thirty-three years less than his father, because it is written קללת חנם לא תבא — for Rachel cursed and said עם אשר תמצא את אלהיך לא יחיה — they were subtracted from him by the count of יחי\"ה, which is thirty-three from his years."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {0 "The phrase בראותו ילדיו appears to be a punning citation of Genesis 48:11; its exact role in the gematria is preserved as in the source."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:38.343706959Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}